The MT7902 Driver does not support linux and Syslack Linux
However thanks to hmtheboy154 for mt7902 drivers


Installation

Install these first sudo apt update
                    sudo apt install -y git dkms bc build-essential linux-headers-$(uname -r)

1 git clone https://github.com/hmtheboy154/mt7902
  cd mt7902

2 sudo make install -j$(nproc)

3 sudo make install_fw

4 sudo modprobe mt7902e

For bluetooth

1 git clone https://github.com/hmtheboy154/mt7902 -b bluetooth_backport btusb_mt7902
  cd btusb_mt7902

2 sudo make install -j$(nproc)

3 sudo make install_fw

4 Reboot
